# PLACEHOLDER test scene for the dialogue player and screen (0702, 0704).
# Uses the placeholder characters from data/characters.ron; the real
# Chapter 1 script (0707) goes in its own files.

@scene test
@caption Village of Heth, dusk
> The rain had not stopped for three days.
@left  test_lord neutral
@right test_knight angry
test_knight: You're late.
test_lord[happy]: Better late than... well.
test_knight: Than never. Say it.
  I've heard it from you often enough.
@right clear
> The knight stamps off into the rain.
@right test_archer surprised
test_archer: Was that about me?
test_lord[sad]: It's always about you.
@end
